{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is currently in development. If you like it, please add it to your wishlist and followus!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600170/extras/aded49f9fba165d42963ae033c64cd3a.poster.avif?t=1768636215\" width=560 height=122 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600170/extras/aded49f9fba165d42963ae033c64cd3a.webm?t=1768636215\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600170/extras/aded49f9fba165d42963ae033c64cd3a.mp4?t=1768636215\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600170/extras/fd556e04e0bfef158a3f454e56613ea2.avif?t=1768636215\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600170/extras_big/fd556e04e0bfef158a3f454e56613ea2.webp?t=1768636215 width=1560 height=85 /></span>ured by promises of a \u201c30K+ monthly salary with free meals and housing,\u201d you pack your bags and fly to Southeast Asia. The moment you land, your passport and phone are confiscated, and a black hood is shoved over your head. You\u2019re crammed into a fake \u201cschool bus\u201d painted bright yellow and driven straight to a telecom scam compound, becoming the latest \u201cpiglet\u201d in their hands. Rumor has it that if you disobey, they\u2019ll \u201charvest your kidneys.\u201d In the dorm hallways, people shout KPIs all day; in the computer rooms, they hammer keyboards through the night. Under barbed wire and searchlights, a \u201cgold-chain boss\u201d roams with an electric baton in hand\u2014right then, you finally understand: that high salary was nothing more than a ticket to a cage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600170/extras/c4961d8e649c69f0032b9378cf421921.avif?t=1768636215\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600170/extras_big/c4961d8e649c69f0032b9378cf421921.webp?t=1768636215 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600170/extras/e73369f8e450e02a962e73617f6f774d.avif?t=1768636215\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600170/extras_big/e73369f8e450e02a962e73617f6f774d.webp?t=1768636215 width=1560 height=88 /></span>Southeast Asia \u2013 Border regions erupt into turmoil, forcing telecom fraud compounds to scatter and relocate. Large numbers of victims and financial operators are sold or reassigned to other compounds, leaving only a handful of \u201cguards,\u201d \u201cstaff,\u201d and the \u201ccompound boss\u201d waiting for the unrest to end so they can \u201crestart their fraud operations.\u201d At this moment, you are lured into a telecom fraud compound in Southeast Asia.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-- Seize this rare window of opportunity: evade the guards, gather clues, crack access controls, and escape to freedom!<br>-- Or decide to put an end to the compound\u2019s cruel \u201cfraud operations,\u201d join forces with your companions, destroy its facilities, and send the evidence to the police!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600170/extras/419997ca2f2bdf7ed5f2dde3d4c94397.avif?t=1768636215\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600170/extras_big/419997ca2f2bdf7ed5f2dde3d4c94397.webp?t=1768636215 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600170/extras/afb7964d906712a773e8b08918151509.avif?t=1768636215\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600170/extras_big/afb7964d906712a773e8b08918151509.webp?t=1768636215 width=1600 height=76 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Split up to infiltrate, disrupt the patrols, and rescue each other \u2014 team up with your friends as a \u201cPiglet Squad,\u201d where every anti-fraud breakout becomes a milestone on your road to escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600170/extras/88e858133a5d2ca51cc5517908556800.avif?t=1768636215\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600170/extras_big/88e858133a5d2ca51cc5517908556800.webp?t=1768636215 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600170/extras/6ba34113c20794cb217bad26e39a93a4.avif?t=1768636215\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600170/extras_big/6ba34113c20794cb217bad26e39a93a4.webp?t=1768636215 width=1600 height=69 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect scam evidence, bypass locks and traps; shut down the surveillance room, cut the </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >power, plan your escape route, avoid patrols, and find the exit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600170/extras/b1c4217d807916e38137c12745faba35.avif?t=1768636215\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600170/extras_big/b1c4217d807916e38137c12745faba35.webp?t=1768636215 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600170/extras/d6d7a337ebda38d24288a78bd41bedb5.avif?t=1768636215\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600170/extras_big/d6d7a337ebda38d24288a78bd41bedb5.webp?t=1768636215 width=1600 height=69 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scout the area, hide in restrooms, memorize patrol patterns, and unlock shortcuts and hiding spots.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600170/extras/ee900b122f7d7be2c295bd4fd699719f.avif?t=1768636215\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600170/extras_big/ee900b122f7d7be2c295bd4fd699719f.webp?t=1768636215 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600170/extras/a5973060fd577833095828c05244e440.webp?t=1768636215\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600170/extras_big/a5973060fd577833095828c05244e440.webp?t=1768636215 width=1600 height=60 /></span>Guards, glamorous croupiers, dismemberment doctors, cafeteria chefs, and the compound boss\u2014when you see them, hide or run quickly, and don\u2019t get caught.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600170/extras/27af3d1dbe15f67ab44aa047850e7acf.avif?t=1768636215\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600170/extras_big/27af3d1dbe15f67ab44aa047850e7acf.webp?t=1768636215 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600170/extras/7ff1bf8a3858fac4aec8066d43a659d8.webp?t=1768636215\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600170/extras_big/7ff1bf8a3858fac4aec8066d43a659d8.webp?t=1768636215 width=1600 height=55 /></span>In the dark, eerie forest, turn on your flashlight, follow the glowing markers to find the signal generator, and call SOS volunteers to drive the rescue vehicle and take you home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600170/extras/347c8a1eba3913acca047bcb7ee5393b.avif?t=1768636215\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600170/extras_big/347c8a1eba3913acca047bcb7ee5393b.webp?t=1768636215 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600170/extras/685b47dd60a00ca5cfc999504ff82521.webp?t=1768636215\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600170/extras_big/685b47dd60a00ca5cfc999504ff82521.webp?t=1768636215 width=1600 height=49 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Destroy the servers, cut off the power station, rescue victims, gather fraud evidence, and send it to the police to help shut down the compound. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you and your teammates choose to fight back and dismantle the entire fraud operation? The ending is up to you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600170/extras/0e829c221d1a07ac4746f70809feb63c.avif?t=1768636215\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600170/extras_big/0e829c221d1a07ac4746f70809feb63c.webp?t=1768636215 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600170/extras/09c73a067f182505ff297cc75b9f7996.avif?t=1768636215\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600170/extras_big/09c73a067f182505ff297cc75b9f7996.webp?t=1768636215 width=1600 height=157 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3600170?t=1768636215","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600170/f82b03b515e7b0bd04fdb3ad9cada933ee77850a/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1768636215","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600170/43577588a0a41f0267217cf212767ed9a5cf0546/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768636215","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600170/43577588a0a41f0267217cf212767ed9a5cf0546/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768636215","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"LAN Co-op","id":48},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is currently in development. If you like it, please add it to your wishlist and followus!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600170/extras/aded49f9fba165d42963ae033c64cd3a.poster.avif?t=1768636215\" width=560 height=122 ><source src=\"https://s