to infiltrate, disrupt the patrols, and rescue each other \u2014 team up with your friends as a \u201cPiglet Squad,\u201d where every anti-fraud breakout becomes a milestone on your road to escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600170/extras/88e858133a5d2ca51cc5517908556800.avif?t=1768636215\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600170/extras_big/88e858133a5d2ca51cc5517908556800.webp?t=1768636215 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600170/extras/6ba34113c20794cb217bad26e39a93a4.avif?t=1768636215\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600170/extras_big/6ba34113c20794cb217bad26e39a93a4.webp?t=1768636215 width=1600 height=69 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect scam evidence, bypass locks and traps; shut down the surveillance room, cut the </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >power, plan your escape route, avoid patrols, and find the exit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600170/extras/b1c4217d807916e38137c12745faba35.avif?t=1768636215\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600170/extras_big/b1c4217d807916e38137c12745faba35.webp?t=1768636215 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600170/extras/d6d7a337ebda38d24288a78bd41bedb5.avif?t=1768636215\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600170/extras_big/d6d7a337ebda38d24288a78bd41bedb5.webp?t=1768636215 width=1600 height=69 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scout the area, hide in restrooms, memorize patrol patterns, and unlock shortcuts and hiding spots.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600170/extras/ee900b122f7d7be2c295bd4fd699719f.avif?t=1768636215\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600170/extras_big/ee900b122f7d7be2c295bd4fd699719f.webp?t=1768636215 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600170/extras/a5973060fd577833095828c05244e440.webp?t=1768636215\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600170/extras_big/a5973060fd577833095828c05244e440.webp?t=1768636215 width=1600 height=60 /></span>Guards, glamorous croupiers, dismemberment doctors, cafeteria chefs, and the compound boss\u2014when you see them, hide or run quickly, and don\u2019t get caught.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600170/extras/27af3d1dbe15f67ab44aa047850e7acf.avif?t=1768636215\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600170/extras_big/27af3d1dbe15f67ab44aa047850e7acf.webp?t=1768636215 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600170/extras/7ff1bf8a3858fac4aec8066d43a659d8.webp?t=1768636215\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600170/extras_big/7ff1bf8a3858fac4aec8066d43a659d8.webp?t=1768636215 width=1600 height=55 /></span>In the dark, eerie forest, turn on your flashlight, follow the glowing markers to find the signal generator, and call SOS volunteers to drive the rescue vehicle and take you home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600170/extras/347c8a1eba3913acca047bcb7ee5393b.avif?t=1768636215\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600170/extras_big/347c8a1eba3913acca047bcb7ee5393b.webp?t=1768636215 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600170/extras/685b47dd60a00ca5cfc999504ff82521.webp?t=1768636215\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600170/extras_big/685b47dd60a00ca5cfc999504ff82521.webp?t=1768636215 width=1600 height=49 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Destroy the servers, cut off the power station, rescue victims, gather fraud evidence, and send it to the police to help shut down the compound. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you and your teammates choose to fight back and dismantle the entire fraud operation? The ending is up to you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600170/extras/0e829c221d1a07ac4746f70809feb63c.avif?t=1768636215\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600170/extras_big/0e829c221d1a07ac4746f70809feb63c.webp?t=1768636215 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600170/extras/09c73a067f182505ff297cc75b9f7996.avif?t=1768636215\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600170/extras_big/09c73a067f182505ff297cc75b9f7996.webp?t=1768636215 width=16